SUMMARY:Hilton Garden Inn Energy Corridor Lunch & Learn
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging Lunch & Learn designed to bring local businesses\, organizations\, and professionals together for an afternoon of networking\, education\, and collaboration. \nEnjoy a freshly prepared lunch while learning about the exceptional meeting and event spaces available at the Hilton Garden Inn Houston Energy Corridor. You’ll have the opportunity to tour our renovated hotel\, explore our flexible meeting venues\, discover our catering options\, and learn how our experienced sales team can help make your next meeting\, training session\, corporate event\, or social gathering a success. \nWhether you’re an executive assistant\, meeting planner\, HR professional\, business owner\, nonprofit leader\, or event organizer\, this event offers valuable ideas\, meaningful connections\, and practical solutions for hosting successful events. \nWhat to Expect\n\nComplimentary chef-prepared lunch\nGuided tour of our meeting and event spaces\nNetworking with local professionals\nHotel and catering presentation\nEvent planning tips and ideas\nExclusive Lunch & Learn booking incentives\nQ&A with our Sales Team\n\nPerfect For\n\nCorporate Meeting Planners\nExecutive Assistants\nOffice Managers\nHuman Resources Professionals\nEvent Planners\nNonprofit Organizations\nChurches\nTraining Coordinators\nSmall Business Owners\nCommunity Organizations\n\nConnect. Learn. Network. Grow. \nDiscover why the Hilton Garden Inn Houston Energy Corridor is the perfect destination for meetings\, trainings\, conferences\, celebrations\, and corporate events.
URL:https://energycorridor.org/event/hilton-garden-inn-energy-corridor-lunch-learn/
LOCATION:Hilton Garden Inn Energy Corridor\, 12245 Katy Freeway\, Houston\, 77079
CATEGORIES:Community Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://energycorridor.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Lunch-and-Learn-Flyer.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Hilton Garden Inn Energy Corridor":MAILTO:pierre.means@hilton.com
END:VEVENT
